OL,3,AOpera singer leads Scottish takeover of
OL,4,Athe Last Night of the Proms
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd it ensured the audience were
OL,7,Ftreated to performances of The
OL,8,FProclaimers' I'm Gonna Be (500 Miles)
OL,9,Fand Bacara's Yes Sir, I Can Boogie
OL,10,Falongside the more traditional Rule
OL,11,FBritannia! and Sit Down, Your're
OL,12,FRocking the Boat.
